HE1bYMDB4sgToR7FHQMIS1uM.jpg?width=600&height=800 600w",600,800,"Image",{"type":6,"value":17},"We were able to stay present and enjoy every Nothing felt  moment.",{"type":9,"value":19},{"src":20,"srcSet":21,"pixelWidth":22,"pixelHeight":14,"alt":15},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/w5dpPjVyDY6YE8aqq2QOY8LI.jpg?width=1200&height=800","https://framerusercontent.com/images/w5dpPjVyDY6YE8aqq2QOY8LI.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=1200&height=800 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/w5dpPjVyDY6YE8aqq2QOY8LI.jpg?scale-down-to=1024&width=1200&height=800 1024w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/w5dpPjVyDY6YE8aqq2QOY8LI.jpg?width=1200&height=800 1200w",1200,{"type":6,"value":24},"Provence, France",{"type":6,"value":26},"Full wedding planning",{"type":6,"value":28},"110",{"type":30,"value":31},"richtext",{"collectionId":32,"pointer":33},"41f716cd-f3dd-4602-a7ec-cf786ec70e92default","[1,[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The challenge\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Planning a destination wedding in Provence meant balancing elegance, logistics, and guest experience across an entire wedding weekend. The couple wanted the celebration to feel warm, intimate, and beautifully relaxed while still delivering a refined and elevated experience for every guest.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Key challenges included:\"]],[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"local-module:canvasComponent/Xq5rQ7YB5:default\",{\"variant\":null,\"GLnkIfV6Q\":\"Coordinating travel and accommodation for guests arriving internationally\",\"CEFvc6F4f\":\"Managing multiple event locations across the wedding weekend\",\"XQwFy4oed\":\"Managing multiple venues across the wedding weekend\",\"fynp7MMZO\":\"Designing an elevated guest experience without feeling overly formal\",\"Wx8m_c4Sb\":\"Preparing weather contingency plans for outdoor celebrations\"},[],[]]]]",{"type":30,"value":35},{"collectionId":32,"pointer":36},"[1,[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"local-module:canvasComponent/Xq5rQ7YB5:default\",{\"variant\":null,\"GLnkIfV6Q\":\"Initial vision & concept session\",\"CEFvc6F4f\":\"Budget creation & tracking\",\"XQwFy4oed\":\"Guest management & RSVPs\",\"fynp7MMZO\":\"Wedding day management\",\"Wx8m_c4Sb\":\"Full vendor sourcing & management\"},[],[]]],[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Our approach\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"We began by designing the complete guest journey from arrival to farewell, ensuring every moment felt intuitive, comfortable, and intentionally paced. From welcome gifting and transportation to event flow and evening transitions, every detail was planned to feel seamless and considered.\"]],[4,\"blockquote\",null,[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The most memorable celebrations are the ones guests never have to think about.\"]]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Our design direction centered on understated romance, timeless styling, and warm hospitality allowing every detail to feel elegant, natural, and deeply personal to the couple.\"]]]",{"type":38,"value":39},"array",[40,50,59,69],{"type":41,"value":42},"object",{"bGiRol_B_":43,"id":48},{"type":9,"value":44},{"src":45,"srcSet":46,"pixelWidth":13,"pixelHeight":47,"alt":15},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/lNaIO5LXGZ6Jf2bLoiMtqVQ3lLQ.jpg?width=600&height=501","https://framerusercontent.com/images/lNaIO5LXGZ6Jf2bLoiMtqVQ3lLQ.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=600&height=501 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/lNaIO5LXGZ6Jf2bLoiMtqVQ3lLQ.jpg?width=600&height=501 600w",501,{"type":6,"value":49},"Zo4z3FxHk",{"type":41,"value":51},{"bGiRol_B_":52,"id":57},{"type":9,"value":53},{"src":54,"srcSet":55,"pixelWidth":13,"pixelHeight":56,"alt":15},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/ypXuFIAthOqV6O8396GD58CuE.jpg?width=600&height=400","https://framerusercontent.com/images/ypXuFIAthOqV6O8396GD58CuE.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=600&height=400 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/ypXuFIAthOqV6O8396GD58CuE.jpg?width=600&height=400 600w",400,{"type":6,"value":58},"w6EbRdYd7",{"type":41,"value":60},{"bGiRol_B_":61,"id":67},{"type":9,"value":62},{"src":63,"srcSet":64,"pixelWidth":65,"pixelHeight":66,"alt":15},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/Lof4cXLgdZW7kkxLID5BM28R1I.jpg?width=614&height=409","https://framerusercontent.com/images/Lof4cXLgdZW7kkxLID5BM28R1I.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=614&height=409 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/Lof4cXLgdZW7kkxLID5BM28R1I.jpg?width=614&height=409 614w",614,409,{"type":6,"value":68},"bLLYaUmbt",{"type":41,"value":70},{"bGiRol_B_":71,"id":75},{"type":9,"value":72},{"src":73,"srcSet":74,"pixelWidth":13,"pixelHeight":56,"alt":15},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/KdTDeQkWyvrseigDZlo7PmKg5M.jpg?width=600&height=400","https://framerusercontent.com/images/KdTDeQkWyvrseigDZlo7PmKg5M.jpg?scale-down-to=512&width=600&height=400 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/KdTDeQkWyvrseigDZlo7PmKg5M.jpg?width=600&height=400 600w",{"type":6,"value":76},"bRwKjN0nN",{"type":30,"value":78},{"collectionId":32,"pointer":79},"[1,[4,\"h2\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The result\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The final celebration was warm, refined, and beautifully effortless from start to finish. Guests experienced a thoughtfully hosted weekend where every transition felt seamless, every detail felt intentional, and the atmosphere remained intimate, elegant, and entirely relaxed.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The result was a wedding that felt true in every sense personal, polished, and deeply memorable.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Highlights of the final experience included:\"]],[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"local-module:canvasComponent/Xq5rQ7YB5:default\",{\"variant\":null,\"GLnkIfV6Q\":\"A romantic outdoor ceremony in the Provençal countryside\",\"CEFvc6F4f\":\"Seamless transitions across each event throughout the weekend\",\"XQwFy4oed\":\"Personalized hospitality moments for every guest\",\"fynp7MMZO\":\"A timeless design story carried across every touchpoint\",\"Wx8m_c4Sb\":\"Calm, polished execution that allowed the couple to remain fully present\"},[],[]]]]",{"type":6,"value":81},"Elara Events",{"type":6,"value":83},"Camille Rose Studio",{"type":6,"value":85},"Maison Fleur Provence",{"type":6,"value":87},"La Table Provençale",{"type":6,"value":89},"Lumière Strings",{"type":6,"value":91},"Ivory Paper Studio",{"type":6,"value":93},"Atelier Bridal Beauty",{"type":6,"value":95},"Domaine de Lumière",{"type":30,"value":97},{"collectionId":32,"pointer":98},"[1,[4,\"div\",{\"className\":\"framer-text-module\",\"style\":{\"width\":\"100%\",\"height\":\"auto\"},\"data-width\":\"fill\"},[3,\"local-module:canvasComponent/Z4uTuAMfA:default\",{\"variant\":null,\"TgQDFZMXJ\":\"They wanted a wedding that felt elegant, intimate, and entirely effortless an experience rooted in thoughtful hospitality, timeless beauty, and the kind of moments that stay with you long after the weekend ends.\",\"PESP6Dt2o\":\"— Elara, founder\"},[],[]]]]",{"type":30,"value":100},{"collectionId":32,"pointer":101},"[1,[4,\"video\",{\"autoPlay\":true,\"loop\":true,\"muted\":true,\"playsInline\":true,\"src\":\"https://framerusercontent.com/images/vOXsdHbIJ8knAD6G0OZ2iEC8.mp4\",\"className\":\"framer-image\"}]]",{"type":6,"value":103},"V4qcqN9nr","{\"from\":\"41f716cd-f3dd-4602-a7ec-cf786ec70e92\",\"limit\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":1},\"select\":[{\"collection\":\"l6A_03Cto\",\"name\":\"ChYKr6MIJ\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"l6A_03Cto\",\"name\":\"HC_cbxaxY\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"l6A_03Cto\",\"name\":\"r9yMXA64W\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"l6A_03Cto\",\"name\":\"NGHOQnhlB\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"l6A_03Cto\",\"name\":\"yjGJGn